@api = http://localhost:5080
@section = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Step 6 - happy path (tuition within the 20,000 limit)
POST {{api}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": "2026-00123", "sectionId": "{{section}}", "tuition": 15000 }

### Step 7 - compensation path (declined, seat released)
POST {{api}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": "2026-00124", "sectionId": "{{section}}", "tuition": 50000 }

### Everything EnrollmentDb holds
GET {{api}}/state

### Sections
GET {{api}}/sections
